    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Cat Clash!</strong></h2>Build and strengthen a cat team with unique abilities through merging and items. Will your team emerge victorious? #MadeWithGodot<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUY YOUR CATS</strong></h2>Buy randomly rolled cats and items from the shop to build your team! Pick from a pool of over 60 unique cats each with their own unique abilities!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/e48b103374c276d9503255a26c11e80b.poster.avif?t=1725648877\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/e48b103374c276d9503255a26c11e80b.webm?t=1725648877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/e48b103374c276d9503255a26c11e80b.mp4?t=1725648877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLE OTHER TEAMS</strong></h2>Watch your cats fight against other teams! Each round, face off against one of many enemy groups.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/137dbbd4c75bf95f8ce8169327bba54b.poster.avif?t=1725648877\" width=600 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/137dbbd4c75bf95f8ce8169327bba54b.webm?t=1725648877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/137dbbd4c75bf95f8ce8169327bba54b.mp4?t=1725648877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPROVE YOUR TEAM</strong></h2>After each fight, improve your team! Level up cats to get access to their stronger abilities, reposition your cats for optimal strategic positions, and give them items and powers to enhance their skills!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/d5e5a522ffde47d70b621ebc6acb34fd.poster.avif?t=1725648877\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/d5e5a522ffde47d70b621ebc6acb34fd.webm?t=1725648877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/d5e5a522ffde47d70b621ebc6acb34fd.mp4?t=1725648877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Cool Modes!</strong> - 4 unique game modes offering different challenges!<br></li><li><strong>Cool Achievements!</strong> - Show off your cat team building prowess through many steam achievements!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Cat Clash!</strong></h2>Build and strengthen a cat team with unique abilities through merging and items. Will your team emerge victorious? #MadeWithGodot<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUY YOUR CATS</strong></h2>Buy randomly rolled cats and items from the shop to build your team! Pick from a pool of over 60 unique cats each with their own unique abilities!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/e48b103374c276d9503255a26c11e80b.poster.avif?t=1725648877\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/e48b103374c276d9503255a26c11e80b.webm?t=1725648877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/e48b103374c276d9503255a26c11e80b.mp4?t=1725648877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLE OTHER TEAMS</strong></h2>Watch your cats fight against other teams! Each round, face off against one of many enemy groups.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/137dbbd4c75bf95f8ce8169327bba54b.poster.avif?t=1725648877\" width=600 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/137dbbd4c75bf95f8ce8169327bba54b.webm?t=1725648877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/137dbbd4c75bf95f8ce8169327bba54b.mp4?t=1725648877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPROVE YOUR TEAM</strong></h2>After each fight, improve your team! Level up cats to get access to their stronger abilities, reposition your cats for optimal strategic positions, and give them items and powers to enhance their skills!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/d5e5a522ffde47d70b621ebc6acb34fd.poster.avif?t=1725648877\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/d5e5a522ffde47d70b621ebc6acb34fd.webm?t=1725648877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082630/extras/d5e5a522ffde47d70b621ebc6acb34fd.mp4?t=1725648877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Cool Modes!</strong> - 4 unique game modes offering different challenges!<br></li><li><strong>Cool Achievements!</strong> - Show off your cat team building prowess through many steam achievements!</li></ul>",
